# named explicitly because it is a DIFFERENT thing from the pre-cutover `dist/`
# leftover beside it: `dist/Rudis/binaries/ffmpeg.exe` is the ONLY surviving copy
# of the pre-SHIP-04 payload (upstream pruned the tag it came from - PROVENANCE.md
# Entry 5), so nobody should ever `rm -rf dist/` to clean release output.
# Reproduced by scripts/release/build-release.ps1.
dist/velopack/
build/
