# 42.1-04: live-run inspection artifacts. Regenerated by the #[ignore]d paid
# tests on every run (decoded frames off a generated clip), never fixtures the
# suite reads back — so they are output, not input.
test-media/veo-live-frame-*.png
test-media/runway-live-*.png

# Phase 57 (plan 57-02) BENCH-02: the two LARGE benchmark fixtures, ~511 MB
# together. Regenerated by scripts/windows/generate-bench-media.ps1, which pins
# every encoding parameter BENCH-01's numbers depend on (codec, dims, fps,
# duration, GOP, bitrate regime) and verifies each one with ffprobe after the
# encode. Benchmark fixtures need to be PARAMETER-identical, not byte-identical
# — unlike the four SMALL solid-colour fixtures next to them, which ARE
# committed because multilayer_pixel_pin.rs asserts their exact composited
# pixels. 511 MB in git history is a permanent clone tax on every future
# checkout, rejected on purpose (Phase 57 constraint 11).
#
# EXACT PATHS, never a test-media/*.mp4 wildcard: dozens of small fixtures in
# this directory are tracked and must stay trackable.
test-media/bars_720p30_240s.mp4
test-media/longgop_4k30_60s.mp4
